# Forge's route search orders the quests of this guide and its guide writer writes the steps.
# Fixes go into data/route-fixes.json, data/guide-fixes.json or forever-db/corrections, never
# into this file.
# Added here: Panther Mastery (193), Raptor Mastery (196).
# Since 2026-11-07 Stranglethorn is done in two visits around Desolace: this first loop at 33-35, the second
# (30-40/04b) at 35-36. Its Booty Bay and Rebel Camp quests up to 37 are taken here, where their givers stand.
# Since the 0.3.7 audit: Bookie Herod's Records (200) are handed in and The Hidden Key (328) taken on this loop's Kurzen
# stop, and Krazek's Cookery (210) goes from Corporal Kaleb to Krazek on it. Level tidy (0.4.0): one top-up to 33.2 on
# the Kurzen Jungle Fighters (32-33) before the elder tigers (34-35), where players are a level over the model.
# Level tidy (0.4.0): Raptor Mastery's Lashtail Raptors (195, 35-36) are hunted on the second loop (04b) at about 36 and
# Tiger Mastery's Sin'Dall (188, level 37) on 40-50/01-stranglethorn-vale's ride to Nesingwary at about 41, not here at
# 33-34; Ajeck and Hemet give them here, where the elder tigers and raptors are handed in. Panther Mastery's Shadowmaw Panthers (192, 37-38) wait for
# 40-50/01-stranglethorn-vale at about 41; Sir S. J. Erlgadin gives it on this loop's hand-in. Since 0.4.1 the loop
# starts at Booty Bay (#2419): 30-40/03 ends in Theramore, so the walk to Ratchet and its boat beat the boat to Menethil,
# the flight to Darkshire and the walk down the jungle and back (level model: 15 minutes less in this guide, no level
# moves). Booty Bay's quests are taken and the hearthstone bound first; Investigate the Camp, the river crocolisks'
# skins (30-31, beside the camp) and Private Thorsen's supplies go in on the first Nesingwary and Rebel Camp stops, and
# the hearthstone brings you back from the coast. Players who know the Stonetalon
# Peak flight fly there from Auberdine instead of Astranaar, closer to Desolace (#2403); warlocks keep Astranaar.
# Zimmix Sputterspark's rescue (97329, 97331), Kebok's Bloodscalp ears (189) and the Stolen Shipments (97328) are worked
# in the ruins of Zul'Kunda on 04b's second loop, at about 36: the ruins' core holds Berserkers, Headhunters and Witch
# Doctors of 36-37, three over players here (fix round 1, 0.4.0). Kebok's and the crate's quests are taken on this loop.

# ---------------------------------------------------------------- Booty Bay

