  accept 616 only Dwarf,Gnome,Human,NightElf -- Krazek
  accept 189 only Dwarf,Gnome,Human,NightElf -- Kebok, in the tavern; upstairs
  accept 213 only Dwarf,Gnome,Human,NightElf -- Kebok: the Tumbled Crystals, on the northern loop
  turnin 98463 optional only Dwarf,Gnome,Human,NightElf -- Nixxrax Fillamug, in the Salty Sailor Tavern; upstairs
  vendor nearest
