# ---------------------------------------------------------------- Nesingwary's hunts

step Panthers, raptors and elder tigers
  tip Back south past Nesingwary: Panthers and Stranglethorn Raptors run in the clearings west of the camp toward the coast; the elder tigers hold the hills south-west.
  kill 736 quest 191 only Dwarf,Gnome,Human,NightElf -- Panther
  accept 635 optional                 -- Gluggle (37, rare) on the coast west of camp drops the Pendant of Myzrael: four levels over you, leave him unless you are grouped
  accept 97328 @31.5,12.8 map 1434    -- Thoroughly Scavenged Supplies, a looted crate west of Nesingwary's camp: the Stolen Shipments lie in the Bloodscalp ruins on the coast, for the second Stranglethorn loop

step Sir S. J. Erlgadin
  tip Back east to Nesingwary's camp on the way north to the Rebel Camp.
  turnin 191 only Dwarf,Gnome,Human,NightElf
  accept 192 only Dwarf,Gnome,Human,NightElf -- keep it: the Shadowmaw Panthers (37-38) wait for the 40-50 Stranglethorn guide

# ---------------------------------------------------------------- Rebel Camp

step Rebel Camp
  tip Take the road north; the camp sits in the hills to the west.
  tip Private Thorsen offers Jungle Secrets only while he is out of the camp: about every half hour he walks down the path to the road, where two Kurzen's Agents ambush him. Help him kill them and take the quest at once, before he walks back up. He isn't there? Leave it: the guide passes Bookie Herod, which follows from it, as well.
  tip Private Thorsen spends most of his time at the top of the Rebel Camp's path, by the huts, and now and then walks down it to the road and back (about eight minutes). If he isn't at the arrow, look along that path.
  accept 210 only Dwarf,Gnome,Human,NightElf -- Corporal Kaleb: for Krazek in Booty Bay, later in this guide
  accept 203 only Dwarf,Gnome,Human,NightElf -- Sergeant Yohwa
  accept 204 only Dwarf,Gnome,Human,NightElf
  accept 215 optional @40.3,8.4 map 1434 era only Dwarf,Gnome,Human,NightElf -- Private Thorsen, at the foot of the path
  turnin 215 only Dwarf,Gnome,Human,NightElf -- Lieutenant Doren, in the hut
  accept 200 only Dwarf,Gnome,Human,NightElf -- Lieutenant Doren: Bookie Herod's records lie at the edge of Kurzen's Compound, next

step Vul'Gol Ogre Mound: kill these as you meet them
  zone Duskwood
  tip Head south-west from Darkshire to the ogre mound. Abercrombie's Crate sits in the camp at its entrance; Splinter Fist ogres guard it. Zzarc' Vul is inside the ogre mound's cave: go in by the cave mouth on the mound's west side.
  accept 96138 optional only Dwarf,Gnome,Human,NightElf -- Only if a Lost Watcher dropped Merrick's Bow: right-click it
  kill 212 x8 quest 96138.1 optional only Dwarf,Gnome,Human,NightElf -- Splinter Fist Warrior
  kill 892 x4 quest 96138.2 optional only Dwarf,Gnome,Human,NightElf -- Splinter Fist Taskmaster
  collect 1968 quest 181.1 @38.0,80.0 map 1431 only Dwarf,Gnome,Human,NightElf -- Below ground

