# ---------------------------------------------------------------- To Desolace

step Boat to Auberdine
  only Warrior,Paladin,Hunter,Rogue,Priest,Shaman,Mage,Druid
  zone Stormwind City
  goto 21.8,56.9 "Boat to Auberdine" live

step Fly to Stonetalon Peak
  when taxi "Stonetalon Peak"
  only Warrior,Paladin,Hunter,Rogue,Priest,Shaman,Mage,Druid
  zone Darkshore
  tip You know the Stonetalon Peak flight: it lands closer to Desolace than Astranaar does. From the peak, follow the road south through the mountains to the Charred Vale.
  zone Stonetalon Mountains
  zone Darkshore
  goto 36.4,45.6 "Auberdine flight master"
  fly "Stonetalon Peak"

step Fly to Astranaar
  when !taxi "Stonetalon Peak"
  zone Darkshore
  zone Ashenvale
  zone Darkshore
  goto 36.4,45.6 "Auberdine flight master"

step Boat to Auberdine
  only Gnome,Human,Warlock
  zone Stormwind City
  goto 21.8,56.9 "Boat to Auberdine" live

step Fly to Astranaar
  when taxi "Stonetalon Peak"
  only Warlock
  zone Darkshore
  tip Warlocks fly to Astranaar for the Heartswood, on the way west.
  zone Ashenvale
  zone Darkshore
  goto 36.4,45.6 "Auberdine flight master"
  fly "Astranaar"

step Heartswood
  only Warlock
  zone Ashenvale
  tip From Astranaar head north-west into the hills: the Heartswood is a glowing tree north of the road to Maestra's Post. If you took What Is Love?, the Wooden Figurine lies in a house among the trees north of Maestra's Post (26.6,22.0). Then take the road west to Stonetalon.
  collect 6912 quest 1738.1               -- Heartswood
  collect 190309 quest 65602.1 optional only Gnome,Human -- Wooden Figurine, north of Maestra's Post
